<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean helicopter crash kills three.</title>
<headline>S.Korean helicopter crash kills three.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South Korean helicopter crashed on Tuesday killing all three crew members, an official at Dong Ah Construction Industrial Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The helicopter, owned by Dong Ah, crashed around 11:40 a.m. (0240 GMT) about 50 km (30 miles) south of Seoul.</p>
<p>Police were investigating, the official said.</p>
